{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>Selina任家萱近來被「CTWANT」拍到，與老公及小孩的日常互動，而她圓潤的身材被部分網友酸「像張秀卿」、「肥大媽」，粉絲為護偶像也回應反擊這些酸民。</p><p>Selina生子兒子小腰果後，重心就轉移到專心照顧孩子，大幅減少了公開活動與工作，隨著近日被拍到最新近況，她的身材明顯與以前相比圓潤了不少，不過她還是會去健身房、打匹克球，來維持運動習慣。</p><figure><img alt=\"Selina任家萱近來身材圓潤被部分網友酸「肥大媽」。（FB@任家萱 Selina﻿）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167071644523433984180792.jpeg/rnvq3K2915H3xy3xHsBV1H50PdvAba7y3mbeb95m3m8\"/><figcaption>Selina任家萱近來身材圓潤被部分網友酸「肥大媽」。（FB@任家萱 Selina﻿）</figcaption></figure><p>更多Selina任家萱身材圓潤前後對比相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"Selina任家萱身材圓潤後相片。（FB@任家萱 Selina﻿）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167072253553152000703198.jpeg/RIcQkE0kV1xSVqdB0v1hSBN3uDFgjbAAcgwgInIMICI\"/><figcaption>Selina任家萱身材圓潤後相片。（FB@任家萱 Selina﻿）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Selina任家萱身材圓潤後相片。（FB@任家萱 Selina﻿）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167072258045513728519067.jpeg/jLfErQX6ms0M0ijqOcjAQBw6CQv5Wp3rHq3gVR6t4FU\"/><figcaption>Selina任家萱身材圓潤後相片。（FB@任家萱 Selina﻿）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Selina任家萱身材圓潤後相片。（FB@任家萱 Selina﻿）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167072260230877184519842.jpeg/rjT7x0WPxF2hKfp2YBlfClGExE_ZOnFLGtNQQxrTUEM\"/><figcaption>Selina任家萱身材圓潤後相片。（FB@任家萱 Selina﻿）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Selina任家萱身材圓潤後相片。（FB@任家萱 Selina﻿）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167072255713349632645872.jpeg/PLBYEaHszqqj1VgnDePOjFXg7eEQjVhtvPZjjLz2Y4w\"/><figcaption>Selina任家萱身材圓潤後相片。（FB@任家萱 Selina﻿）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Selina任家萱（左）身材圓潤後相片。（FB@任家萱 Selina﻿）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167072262542069760502971.jpeg/cyPebw1yXIZSclD30uiRbT5edEACIx12WTj8PFk4_Dw\"/><figcaption>Selina任家萱（左）身材圓潤後相片。（FB@任家萱 Selina﻿）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Selina任家萱（右）身材圓潤後相片。（IG@mylove__hebe0330﻿）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167072253095972864798306.jpeg/rD1rbvXbrfGzZdpy_v6fs3Pj6KCydkSKrDXg7qw14O4\"/><figcaption>Selina任家萱（右）身材圓潤後相片。（IG@mylove__hebe0330﻿）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2016年S.H.E写真照。（Facebook @Selina任家萱）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20170208/1486516545589a714183be7.jpg/YuNV2V5H3_5d-EG-aSdJdo2YbMlCqW-CnuhAiJ7oQIg\"/><figcaption>2016年S.H.E写真照。（Facebook @Selina任家萱）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2016年SHE姐妹合照（微博@嘉桦ella）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20160217/145566738156c3b8b506e3f.jpg/CqeTDeG12Qp_JOF9JNkmqSry-L4nO6EbQ-4jyUPuI8k\"/><figcaption>2016年SHE姐妹合照（微博@嘉桦ella）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Selina任家萱舊時相片。（mv截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167077154660290560463180.jpeg/tHH9zndbx7ik1lIyzR6KWpwDWksdWQCCCrPsAgqz7AI\"/><figcaption>Selina任家萱舊時相片。（mv截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Selina任家萱舊時相片。（mv截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167077156757573632051897.jpeg/xJIXwnqkZA6YxrALgq7IwZdeeNTRE_bO8z_GbPM_xmw\"/><figcaption>Selina任家萱舊時相片。（mv截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Selina任家萱舊時相片。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167077283106656256813074.jpeg/sBL1vRG9VjigqQJKwKaAK1Q86_zOp5iN0T_MDtE_zA4\"/><figcaption>Selina任家萱舊時相片。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>但仍免不了成為酸民攻擊的目標，粉絲們力挺Selina紛紛留言回擊：</p><p>「說她不瘦的人有什麼毛病，為什麼一定要瘦啊」</p><p>「這就是她一直以來都在嚮往的生活了」</p><p>「不懂別人的幸福到底關酸民什麼事」</p><p>「開開心心活著不很好嗎？」</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：女團始祖成員演唱會因做「真空滾胃」見晒骨　令粉絲勁驚訝兼擔心】陳嘉樺（Ella）於西安舉行巡迴演唱會。(ig@him_ella0618)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260309/1107505406873309184368495.jpeg/sN9utH1R7Hw1fem91_e44PG9stFfHPEjS1ILCEtSCwg\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：女團始祖成員演唱會因做「真空滾胃」見晒骨　令粉絲勁驚訝兼擔心】陳嘉樺（Ella）於西安舉行巡迴演唱會。(ig@him_ella0618)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ella即興展示了一個高難度瑜伽動作「真空滾胃」。(thread圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260309/1107505404159463424630195.png/-Hblxa0DHCwI_jo0iO1VPN4JXn_6p-A4_ZeT9f2Xk_U\"/><figcaption>Ella即興展示了一個高難度瑜伽動作「真空滾胃」。(thread圖片)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ella當晚以精緻的舞台造型亮相。(ig@him_ella0618)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260309/1107505969895837696247691.jpeg/wq3zSXxBWKOMO2S9tzpUNHRA5Fz9k_Vd7eSZKu3kmSo\"/><figcaption>Ella當晚以精緻的舞台造型亮相。(ig@him_ella0618)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"近年Ella一直投入大量時間進行運動及體態管理。(ig@him_ella0618)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260309/1107505966997442560726134.png/faVUV2ggBwI1hOEDqkcQYysdbp3hXU833teCUt7XglI\"/><figcaption>近年Ella一直投入大量時間進行運動及體態管理。(ig@him_ella0618)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"都唔怪得咁多粉絲覺得恐怖。(thread圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260309/1107505964010967040587612.png/MOnzjWIztNSrTyiqJnXXt3HkdXHEjPKoxjzwvMY88Lw\"/><figcaption>都唔怪得咁多粉絲覺得恐怖。(thread圖片)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ella仲一連做咗兩次。(thread圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260309/1107506224536096768670152.png/hnu5T8--VNl8AZLJV2JQF7b6c0fACtYOUwKJVlMCiVY\"/><figcaption>Ella仲一連做咗兩次。(thread圖片)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ella的「真空滾胃」畫面引來部分網民的擔憂。(thread圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260309/1107506221700616192724819.png/AjnuFx67nnVKsI4odEuuwm2sjNhTJnBobJmhk2yZoZM\"/><figcaption>Ella的「真空滾胃」畫面引來部分網民的擔憂。(thread圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>S.H.E合體挑戰大巨蛋？Selina私約2姐妹這麼說</p><p>動力火車大爆料！尤秋興抱怨顏志琳下半身「一堆毛病」</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T07:40:22.814980+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1027,"images":19,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}